# #6166. Pairs with BirthCloseHeld: the shard marker's retention drops an evicted
# bulk-switch close instead of folding its heads into the compacted bulk heads, so a
# leaf whose own marker holds no birth close - here the never-written load's, which
# stores no leaf count - is released below its switch's close.
MODULE: BirthCloseHeldEvictionDropsClose
TARGET: BirthCloseHeld
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an evicted bulk-switch close is dropped rather than folded into the compacted bulk heads
PERTURBS: Evict
BOUNDS: NeverWritten = 1

--- FIND
    /\ compactBulk' = MaxN(compactBulk, closeHead)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the evicted close is dropped.
    /\ compactBulk' = compactBulk
--- END
